.TH G15-FANCTL-GUI 1 "2026-07-26" "g15-fanctl 0.1.0" "Dell G15 Fan Control Center"
.SH NAME
g15-fanctl-gui \- GTK4 GUI for the Dell G15 Fan Control Center
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B g15-fanctl-gui
.SH DESCRIPTION
Dashboard, fan control, thermal profile, and custom fan curve GUI for the
Dell G15 5530. Communicates with the
.B g15-fancontrold
system service over D-Bus and holds no privileges of its own.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR g15-fancontrold (1),
.BR g15fanctl (1)
